Engineering.
purpose: def"Engineering is the CE-OS engineering subsystem. It owns engineering representation, calculation, semantic execution, native model translation, geometry construction, and engineering project outputs.";
status: def"Active reconstruction from current repository implementation. Repository behavior and passing tests take precedence over stale Engineering documentation.";
authority: def"Engineering produces engineering models, calculations, geometry, packets, and candidate outputs. Engineering execution does not by itself establish physical validation, safety, operational readiness, or operator acceptance.";


